  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Minor in Organizational Leadership"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Minors",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Minors",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/minors/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The Minor in Organizational Leadership focuses on developing the foundation knowledge and competencies required to successfully lead and manage many different types of organizations. The goal of the Minor is to improve the student's ability to influence, motivate and enable others to contribute toward the effectiveness and success of organizations of which they are members. In addition to courses on leadership, the Minor includes courses on the management of organizational change, interpersonal dynamics, cross-cultural dimensions of OB, negotiation and conflict resolution and organization theory."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Administered by: Ted Rogers School of Business Management, Human Resources and Organizational Behaviour Department"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Exclusions: This minor is not available to students in the following programs:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Business Management - Human Resources Management Major (regular and co-operative options)",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Business Management - Human Resources Management Major",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/programs/trsm/business_mgt/human_resources_management_major/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "To receive this Minor, students must complete six (6) courses from the following curriculum:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Required courses (2):"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "MHR 405 Organizational Behaviour or HTH 601 Organizational Behaviour",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "MHR 405",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/human-resources/MHR/405/"
        },
        {
          "text": "HTH 601",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/hospitality-and-tourism-management/HTH/601/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "MHR 640 Leadership",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "MHR 640",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/human-resources/MHR/640/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Plus four (4) of the following:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "MHR 650 Management of Change",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "MHR 650",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/human-resources/MHR/650/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "MHR 700 Cross-Cultural Dimensions of Organizational Behaviour",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "MHR 700",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/human-resources/MHR/700/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "MHR 721 Negotiation and Conflict Resolution",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "MHR 721",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/human-resources/MHR/721/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "MHR 741 Managing Interpersonal Dynamics and Teams",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "MHR 741",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/human-resources/MHR/741/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "MHR 841 Organization Theory and Design",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "MHR 841",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/human-resources/MHR/841/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "MHR 850 Coaching, Facilitation and Internal Consulting",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "MHR 850",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/human-resources/MHR/850/"
        }
      ]
    },
